# KnowEvo docx build scratch — the deliverable .docx is reproduced from
# content.py + generate.js, so its dependencies stay out of the tree
competition/deliverables/build-docx/node_modules/
competition/deliverables/build-docx/package-lock.json

# Locally generated packaging output. 05-代码附件 is a `git archive HEAD` snapshot of
# this repository itself: self-referential, its content changes with every
# commit, so tracking it would copy the repository into the repository and it
# would always be stale. 06-截图 and 01-开发设计文档/*.docx are copies of files that
# already live under competition/deliverables/, and the 04 tarball likewise.
# They stay on local disk for packaging only; the reproduction record is the
# MANIFEST.sha256 in competition/deliverables/submission-package/.
competition/deliverables/submission-package/05-代码附件/
competition/deliverables/submission-package/06-截图/
competition/deliverables/submission-package/*/*.docx
competition/deliverables/submission-package/04-MCP与知识库文件实体/*.tar.gz

